  "name": "accordion-sim",
  "description": "A high-fidelity aeroacoustic simulator that implements the fluid-structure interaction of free reeds coupled with a thermodynamic gas system. It employs compressible flow equations and multi-mode cantilever beam dynamics to model the self-oscillation of reeds driven by bellows-induced pressure differentials. The project features a real-time synthesis engine with low-latency audio output and a diagnostic GUI for monitoring physical state variables.",
